<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#080d1b">

  <title>RenzoNexus — One World. Endless Possibilities.</title>

  <meta name="description" content="Discover products, independent brands, merchandise and events through RenzoNexus — One World. Endless Possibilities.">

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #080d1b;
      --panel: #10182b;
      --panel2: #131e35;
      --blue: #66a6ff;
      --cyan: #65e6ff;
      --purple: #9a83ff;
      --white: #f4f7ff;
      --muted: #9aa8c3;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      --gold: #e9c77b;
      --radius: 22px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--white);
      font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, h4, .brand {
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button, input, textarea, select {
      font: inherit;
    }

    button {
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:disabled {
      opacity: .55;
      cursor: wait;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1160px, 92%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    .announcement {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #132e56, #30245b, #132e56);
      color: #dbe8ff;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: .5px;
    }

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(8,13,27,.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .nav {
      min-height: 76px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -.7px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), var(--purple));
      color: #081021;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px #658aff35;
    }

    .brand span span {
      color: var(--cyan);
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 23px;
      color: #c4cee1;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--cyan);
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 19px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      transition: .2s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: var(--blue);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      color: #071020;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--cyan), var(--blue));
      border: 0;
    }

    .btn-gold {
      color: #17120a;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #f3dca4, #d3a64d);
      border: 0;
    }

    .btn-small {
      padding: 9px 13px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      padding: 100px 0 82px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 12% 20%, #2553a933, transparent 38%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 30%, #8b5cf633, transparent 34%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0a1123, var(--bg));
    }

    .hero:after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      opacity: .13;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image: radial-gradient(#8ab8ff 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 35px 35px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black, transparent);
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border: 1px solid #66a6ff50;
      background: #66a6ff0e;
      border-radius: 100px;
      color: #b7d7ff;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.7px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow:before {
      content: "";
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      background: var(--cyan);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--cyan);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: 27px 0 20px;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 78px);
      line-height: 1.06;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(100deg, #fff, #79caff 45%, #b9a4ff);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .hero-note {
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #8392af;
    }

    .search-wrap {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 40px auto 0;
      padding: 7px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #121c31;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff20;
      border-radius: 17px;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 60px #0004;
    }

    .search-wrap input {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      border: 0;
      outline: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: white;
      padding: 13px 15px;
    }

    .search-wrap input::placeholder {
      color: #8492ae;
    }

    section {
      padding: 75px 0;
      scroll-margin-top: 85px;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .section-kicker {
      color: var(--cyan);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 39px);
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .section-head p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 490px;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 7px;
    }

    .categories {
      display: flex;
      gap: 9px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .category {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: #bdc9df;
      background: #ffffff04;
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 9px 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .category.active, .category:hover {
      background: #66a6ff18;
      border-color: #66a6ff8a;
      color: white;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111b30, #0c1324);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: .25s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: #80aaff55;
    }

    .card-image {
      height: 210px;
      position: relative;
      background: #15223b;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .card-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform .4s ease;
    }

    .card:hover .card-image img {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: 13px;
      left: 13px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      background: #081020dc;
      color: #d5e9ff;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff24;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .card-body {
      padding: 19px;
    }

    .card-body h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .card-body p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .card-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 15px;
    }

    .card-footer span {
      color: #dce7ff;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .card-footer strong {
      color: var(--cyan);
    }

    .wide-feature {
      position: relative;
      border-radius: 27px;
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 320px;
      padding: 45px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, #0a1020 0%, #0a1020e8 40%, #0a102055 100%),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506157786151-b8491531f063?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=85") center/cover;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff1a;
    }

    .wide-feature .feature-content {
      max-width: 510px;
    }

    .wide-feature h2 {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 47px);
      line-height: 1.12;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }

    .wide-feature p {
      color: #c2cee4;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .split {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      min-height: 270px;
      padding: 30px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, #6f76ff28, transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(145deg, #121e35, #0c1324);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 49px;
      height: 49px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: #66a6ff1b;
      border: 1px solid #66a6ff33;
      font-size: 23px;
      margin-bottom: 23px;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 23px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 21px;
    }

    .account-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;
      gap: 25px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .account-intro {
      padding: 15px 5px;
    }

    .account-intro h2 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 47px);
      line-height: 1.12;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    .account-intro p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .account-box {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111c32, #0c1323);
      border-radius: 23px;
      padding: 25px;
    }

    .tabs {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 5px;
      background: #080e1b;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .tab {
      padding: 10px;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--muted);
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .tab.active {
      background: #1a2b49;
      color: white;
    }

    .field {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .field label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #c6d2e8;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    .field input, .field textarea, .field select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px 13px;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff1a;
      background: #080e1b;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      outline: none;
    }

    .field input:focus, .field textarea:focus, .field select:focus {
      border-color: var(--blue);
    }

    .field textarea {
      min-height: 105px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .field select option {
      background: #10182b;
    }

    .full {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .form-note {
      margin-top: 13px;
      color: #8595b2;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .message {
      display: none;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .message.show {
      display: block;
    }

    .message.success {
      background: #123b2c;
      color: #b9ffda;
      border: 1px solid #287a55;
    }

    .message.error {
      background: #411c29;
      color: #ffc4d0;
      border: 1px solid #7d3549;
    }

    .account-status {
      display: none;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #66a6ff45;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #66a6ff0d;
    }

    .account-status.show {
      display: block;
    }

    .account-status p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin: 7px 0 14px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .application-box {
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding-top: 23px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .application-box h3 {
      font-size: 19px;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    .application-box > p {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 17px;
    }

    .hidden {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .trust-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 15px;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .trust-item {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 17px;
      background: #ffffff03;
    }

    .trust-item strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .trust-item span {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .cta {
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff14;
      border-radius: 25px;
      padding: 50px 25px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, #648aff22, transparent 65%),
        #0d1527;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 43px);
      margin-bottom: 13px;
    }

    .cta p {
      max-width: 590px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 45px 0 25px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: #070b15;
    }

    .footer-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 25px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      max-width: 340px;
    }

    .footer-brand p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #aab7cf;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .copyright {
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: #73829e;
      font-size: 11px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      left: 50%;
      bottom: 20px;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(120px);
      z-index: 100;
      max-width: 92%;
      padding: 13px 18px;
      background: #172540;
      color: white;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff20;
      border-radius: 13px;
      font-size: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 35px #0007;
      transition: .3s ease;
    }

    .toast.show {
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
    }

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .account-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 75px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .nav {
        min-height: 67px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .logo {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
      }

      .nav > .btn {
        padding: 9px 11px;
        font-size: 11px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        letter-spacing: -1.7px;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .search-wrap {
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 10px;
      }

      .search-wrap .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }

      section {
        padding: 55px 0;
      }

      .section-head {
        align-items: start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .grid, .split {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .card-image {
        height: 220px;
      }

      .wide-feature {
        padding: 27px;
        min-height: 330px;
      }

      .feature-card {
        padding: 25px;
      }

      .account-box {
        padding: 18px;
      }

      .trust-strip {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .copyright {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="announcement">
    A WORLD OF POSSIBILITIES. ONE NEXUS.
  </div>

  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="RenzoNexus homepage">
        <div class="logo">R</div>
        <span>Renzo<span>Nexus</span></span>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#discover">Discover</a>
        <a href="#events">Events</a>
        <a href="#merch">Merch</a>
        <a href="#sell">Sell With Us</a>
        <a href="#account">Account</a>
      </nav>

      <a href="#account" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started ↗</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Your world, connected</span>

          <h1>
            One World.<br>
            <span class="gradient-text">Endless Possibilities.</span>
          </h1>

          <p>
            Discover products, explore experiences, support independent
            brands and find your next favourite event — all in one place.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#discover" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Marketplace ↗</a>
            <a href="#events" class="btn">Discover Events</a>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-note">
            A growing platform built to connect people, products and experiences.
          </div>
        </div>

        <form class="search-wrap" id="searchForm">
          <input
            type="search"
            id="searchInput"
            placeholder="Explore fashion, accessories, events..."
            aria-label="Search sample listings"
          >
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Explore →</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="discover">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker">The marketplace</div>
            <h2>Discover Something Different.</h2>
            <p>
              Explore a vision of a marketplace that brings independent
              sellers, products and customers together.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="categories" aria-label="Listing filters">
          <button class="category active" data-filter="all">All</button>
          <button class="category" data-filter="fashion">Fashion</button>
          <button class="category" data-filter="tech">Technology</button>
          <button class="category" data-filter="lifestyle">Lifestyle</button>
          <button class="category" data-filter="art">Art & Design</button>
        </div>

        <div class="grid" id="productGrid">
          <article class="card listing" data-category="fashion" data-search="fashion streetwear urban clothing">
            <div class="card-image">
